<!--
  TokenWatch's Sparkle appcast, served at https://tokenwatch.fyi/appcast.xml via GitHub Pages
  (this file lives in docs/, the Pages root -- see CNAME).

  Regenerated automatically by scripts/release.sh (via Sparkle's generate_appcast tool) every
  release; do not hand-edit <item> entries. See DISTRIBUTION.md's "Auto-update (Sparkle)"
